 thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1375441,\"title\":\"Primetime\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lmrulvLbmaejTix1YaMxo1oGhH1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sEsMwSDUWGIx9EfNxzM6KzVSsSQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2006, To Catch a Predator host Chris Hansen sets out to make television history. When a high stakes operation goes fatally wrong, his veneered dream of fame curdles into a nightmare of performative justice.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1571955,\"title\":\"Collision Course\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s2eAK0uiODjlNUSIiOBwdp3at2u.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uI3kWI7kGW5E0F8WduewgQYPt34.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Spain, 2013. After robbing a bank, a getaway crash reveals the hidden side of each thief, exposing betrayals and lies that began long before the heist.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":414906,\"title\":\"The Batman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rvtdN5XkWAfGX6xDuPL6yYS2seK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In his second year of fighting crime, Batman uncovers corruption in Gotham City that connects to his own family while facing a serial killer known as the Riddler.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2034,\"title\":\"Training Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bUeiwBQdupBLQthMCHKV7zv56uv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuO8o9ltxhI7AZQxePavEZ4TyHa.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On his first day on the job as a narcotics officer, a rookie cop works with a rogue detective who isn't what he appears.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1290821,\"title\":\"Shelter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cv7DeQQ7TOozPoTCBdNJIvWKhU1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHxWyy18SvAZ8jJeemtS8k1UNjM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man living in self-imposed exile on a remote island rescues a young girl from a violent storm, setting off a chain of events that forces him out of seclusion to protect her from enemies tied to his past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"aoSqx24_DA8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pkp-zt-7ULg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pkI1OcgW9ck\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}